WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:06.470
To many, Nikola Tesla was a genius, unappreciated
in his own time.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:12.440
Born in the Austrian Empire in 1856, the Serbian
American inventor was arguably one of the

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:17.410
most brilliant minds of his day, and yet Tesla
never reached the level of fame and acclaim

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.540
that he perhaps deserved.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:25.070
For those of you who are unfamiliar with his
work, Nikola Tesla was a mechanical and electrical

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:30.250
engineer, best known for his contributions
to the designs for what would become the modern

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.890
alternating current electricity supply system,
or “AC.”

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:39.760
It was Tesla’s hope that he could patent
and sell his inventions, that the creations

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.470
and advancements he made would help to improve
the lives of everyday people.

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:50.100
Unfortunately, due to the ruthless and callous
business practices of his rival, Thomas Edison,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:55.140
much of Nikola Tesla’s work faded into obscurity
after his death in 1943.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:01:01.170
However, what if one of his inventions was
not only a success, but proved so deadly in

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:04.530
its intended function that it had to be contained?

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:09.200
And who better to keep something like that
secured than the experts in anomalous entities,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.880
objects, and technology: The SCP Foundation.

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:19.390
Meet the Teleforce, one of the surviving inventions
of Nikola Tesla’s legacy, better known to

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:23.590
our friends at the Foundation as SCP-2700.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:27.920
While most information about various anomalies
is kept secret by the Foundation through the

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:34.430
use of memory altering drugs called amnestics,
SCP-2700 may be one of the few anomalies that

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:36.310
the public is aware of.

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:40.920
Or at least, they might be aware of the proposed
concept of the Teleforce.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.950
Tesla himself described the invention as a
type of weapon that would fire pellets or

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.409
rounds of material.

00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:50.960
However, rather than acting like a conventional
firearm, the Teleforce would launch these

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:56.240
projectiles at high velocity from inside a
vacuum chamber, using electrostatic repulsion

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:59.259
to fire these rounds at the intended target.

00:01:59.259 --> 00:02:03.159
This probably sounds like a weapon pulled
straight from early works of science fiction,

00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:07.110
but Nikola Tesla claimed that it was an idea
that came to him after he studied the Van

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.700
de Graaf generator.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.870
It was Tesla’s hope that his Teleforce could
be used as a defensive weapon that could either

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:18.120
be deployed against enemy infantry on ground
level, or even be fired at aircraft with enough

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.870
power to bring them down.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:23.440
However, word of this invention soon got out
to the public.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:28.840
In 1934, a number of New York newspapers referred
to the Teleforce using the fear mongering

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.819
description of a “death ray.”

00:02:30.819 --> 00:02:36.440
Whether this was just a misunderstanding or
done to incite mistrust in Tesla and his work,

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.310
it forced the inventor to address the matter
publicly, saying:

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:44.129
“This invention of mine does not contemplate
the use of any so-called 'death rays.'

00:02:44.129 --> 00:02:48.770
Rays are not applicable because they cannot
be produced in requisite quantities and diminish

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.690
rapidly in intensity with distance.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.970
All the energy of New York City transformed
into rays and projected twenty miles, could

00:02:55.970 --> 00:03:01.300
not kill a human being, because, according
to a well-known law of physics, it would disperse

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.440
to such an extent as to be ineffectual.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.940
My apparatus projects particles...”

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.100
As for the device itself?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:13.300
Well, the SCP Foundation was able to uncover
a seemingly perfected version of the Teleforce

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:18.200
in 1946, three years after Nikola Tesla’s
death.

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:23.269
Found in an abandoned research facility believed
to have been used by Tesla himself, SCP-2700

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:28.140
seemed to be the weapon that the Serbian inventor
had described.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.840
It was only when the SCP Foundation began
to take a closer look at the device that their

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:35.680
researchers realized something.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:41.170
SCP-2700 could have been even more dangerous
than Tesla had intended the Teleforce to be

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.720
in his original designs for the weapon.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:47.269
The device itself is made from three main
components.

00:03:47.269 --> 00:03:52.150
First is the interface, designated SCP-2700-1.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:57.130
This is a metal console, complete with a qwerty
keyboard and a display screen, along with

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:02.790
a number of buttons, switches, dials and levers,
each responsible for controlling a key aspect

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:04.650
of SCP-2700.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:10.670
SCP-2700-1 features a command based operating
system, with any command typed on the keyboard

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:13.840
appearing on screen in green block text.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.619
The Foundation is still baffled as to how
an engineer like Tesla, even one as gifted

00:04:18.619 --> 00:04:23.379
as he, was able to create an operating system
like this with the limitations of technology

00:04:23.379 --> 00:04:25.919
during the early 1940s.

00:04:25.919 --> 00:04:32.050
A network of conductive copper wiring then
connects the SCP-2700-1 control console to

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:41.939
the other two components of SCP-2700, appropriately
known as SCP-2700-2 and SCP-2700-3.

00:04:41.939 --> 00:04:47.159
Foundation researchers tasked with examining
and understanding the Teleforce believe the

00:04:47.159 --> 00:04:51.139
SCP-2700-2 part of the device to be a particle
accelerator.

00:04:51.139 --> 00:04:56.089
Now, it’s hard to go into exactly how particle
accelerators work in this video, but we’ll

00:04:56.089 --> 00:04:58.629
do our best to keep it short and simple.

00:04:58.629 --> 00:05:03.729
Like the name suggests, a particle accelerator's
job is to increase the speed of subatomic

00:05:03.729 --> 00:05:06.529
particles like protons or electrons.

00:05:06.529 --> 00:05:10.689
Basically, particle accelerators create a
beam of these particles that have been charged

00:05:10.689 --> 00:05:15.449
to hold extremely high amounts of energy,
and these charged particle beams are often

00:05:15.449 --> 00:05:18.759
useful for a number of different scientific
research methods.

00:05:18.759 --> 00:05:23.229
That’s what the big particle accelerator
up at CERN is used for.

00:05:23.229 --> 00:05:29.979
This one, SCP-2700-2, on the other hand is,
well, it’s not for research per se.

00:05:29.979 --> 00:05:34.539
It’s held securely in a lead-lined tungsten
chamber, in the shape of a cylinder.

00:05:34.539 --> 00:05:39.939
Although it contains all the parts you’d
expect to find in a modern day particle accelerator,

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:44.979
SCP-2700-2 is a lot smaller at just 7.35 meters
long.

00:05:44.979 --> 00:05:51.080
Then, we get to SCP-2700-3, the core of the
Teleforce.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:56.520
Also composed of lead-lined tungsten, it is
a spherical frame with an apparatus inside,

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.179
visible through a silica glass porthole on
one side.

00:06:00.179 --> 00:06:05.289
Within this outer sphere is another, smaller
sphere frame, that was built using an unidentified

00:06:05.289 --> 00:06:06.490
material.

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:10.409
According to notes that the Foundation has
recovered, Tesla himself wrote that the space

00:06:10.409 --> 00:06:13.699
inside this sphere is held in a perpetual
vacuum state.

00:06:13.699 --> 00:06:20.490
But what is perhaps most interesting, and
concerning, about SCP-2700-3 isn’t the metal

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:25.249
frame itself, but rather what is held inside
of it.

00:06:25.249 --> 00:06:31.770
Glowing at the center is the fourth and final
component of Teleforce, known only as SCP-2700-Omega.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:37.569
This, as far as the best minds of the SCP
Foundation can tell, is the power source of

00:06:37.569 --> 00:06:38.569
the weapon.

00:06:38.569 --> 00:06:43.749
It is an anomaly in and of itself, a phenomenon
of energy that does not behave within the

00:06:43.749 --> 00:06:46.129
normal laws of physics.

00:06:46.129 --> 00:06:52.749
Specifically, SCP-2700-Omega directly contradicts
what is known as entropy.

00:06:52.749 --> 00:07:00.110
Due to these abnormal properties, the space
within SCP-2700-3 containing SCP-2700-Omega

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:03.039
does not obey standard rules of time.

00:07:03.039 --> 00:07:07.490
The flow of time within the power source’s
chamber seems to be reversed somehow.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:13.509
However, researchers have noted that the frame
and inner sphere of SCP-2700-3 that surround

00:07:13.509 --> 00:07:19.259
SCP-2700-Omega seem to be unaffected by these
anomalous effects.

00:07:19.259 --> 00:07:25.409
It is because of this power source that SCP-2700
is even more dangerous than Nikola Tesla would

00:07:25.409 --> 00:07:27.379
have ever intended.

00:07:27.379 --> 00:07:31.490
Never mind the fact that the Teleforce weapon
was designed to fire super-charged high velocity

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:36.939
rounds at a target, the sole component powering
it could prove to be devastatingly destructive

00:07:36.939 --> 00:07:41.050
itself, if it ever broke out from within its
frame.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:45.149
According to predictions and calculations
made by the SCP Foundation’s top scientific

00:07:45.149 --> 00:07:51.449
researchers, if SCP-2700-Omega was ever to
be released or accidentally break free from

00:07:51.449 --> 00:07:58.050
the SCP-2700-3 apparatus that contains it,
then the result would be catastrophic.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:03.949
The power source’s anomalous properties,
resisting the laws of physics and time themselves,

00:08:03.949 --> 00:08:06.189
would cause a massive chain reaction.

00:08:06.189 --> 00:08:10.689
The rest of the universe would be converted
to the same inverted state of entropy that

00:08:10.689 --> 00:08:18.909
SCP-2700-Omega exists in, which would ultimately
lead to a YK Class Entropic Annihilation Event.

00:08:18.909 --> 00:08:24.259
The whole universe as we know it would be
pulled inwards, creating an infinitely energetic

00:08:24.259 --> 00:08:25.430
singularity.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:31.929
In short, it would be the Big Bang but in
reverse, with all of creation pulled inside

00:08:31.929 --> 00:08:32.929
out.

00:08:32.929 --> 00:08:34.769
The worst part of all of this?

00:08:34.769 --> 00:08:41.539
According to the read-outs on SCP-2700-1’s
display monitor, the Teleforce has been armed.

00:08:41.539 --> 00:08:47.300
Counting down, the weapon is scheduled to
activate in the year 2234, exactly three hundred

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:51.440
years after being armed, most likely by Tesla
himself.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:57.319
If the device was to ever fully activate,
SCP-2700-Omega would be breached, and the

00:08:57.319 --> 00:09:01.350
entire universe could be unraveled and sucked
into a singularity.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:07.120
The only hope the SCP Foundation has of preventing
this destruction, is to destroy or contain

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.199
SCP-2700 within another SCP.

00:09:10.199 --> 00:09:15.779
The O5 Council are still searching for a suitable
candidate should the worst come to pass.

00:09:15.779 --> 00:09:19.920
For now, personnel have been instructed to
avoid tampering with the Teleforce in any

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.730
way, shape or form.

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:27.069
Should SCP-2700-Omega show any change in its
behavior, then let’s just hope that the

00:09:27.069 --> 00:09:31.440
Overseer Council is able to produce an anomaly
capable of neutralizing it.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.269
But there’s still one other big question
that needs answering.

00:09:35.269 --> 00:09:41.311
Namely, how on Earth did Nikola Tesla, a scientist
limited by the technology of his time, create

00:09:41.311 --> 00:09:45.320
a power source like SCP-2700-Omega?

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:50.579
Something with the capability to unravel the
entire universe if it ever breached its containment?

00:09:50.579 --> 00:09:54.290
Well, the man himself may have given us the
answers.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:10:00.800
The SCP Archive’s file on SCP-2700 concludes
with an extract of a log that Nikola Tesla

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.660
kept during the last decade of his life.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:08.290
As was mentioned before, Tesla was not exactly
a success in his own time.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:13.199
He chose to keep trying to produce his inventions
despite driving himself towards financial

00:10:13.199 --> 00:10:14.199
ruin.

00:10:14.199 --> 00:10:16.680
He was the Vincent Van Gogh of science.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:21.350
Depression took a hold of the inventor in
his later years, until one day he was approached

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.300
by a mysterious figure.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:28.230
This man, as it turned out, was a traveler
from another universe, and brought Tesla with

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.579
him to this alternate reality.

00:10:30.579 --> 00:10:36.290
In his log book, Nikola lamented over how
discontent he was with his life in our universe,

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:39.630
and how transcendentally beautiful it was
in this new one.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:44.120
While there, Tesla worked with a group of
fellow scientists, all brought to that universe

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:49.100
by the same traveler, with the goal of creating
a source of perpetual energy.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:53.760
This power source was intended to break the
known laws of thermodynamics, and it seemed

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:59.839
that SCP-2700-Omega itself was the outcome
of these scientific minds coming together.

00:10:59.839 --> 00:11:04.879
By combining two substances from two universes
with completely different laws of physics

00:11:04.879 --> 00:11:09.610
to our own, Tesla and the others created the
power source they had dreamed of.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:12.069
But things quickly started to go wrong.

00:11:12.069 --> 00:11:18.120
Tesla realized that the core, later known
as SCP-2100-Omega, was somehow moving backwards

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.240
in time.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:23.959
As he tried to correct it, he realized the
device had been locked, and that someone had

00:11:23.959 --> 00:11:25.040
armed it.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.040
Why?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.840
The traveler revealed that this was his plan
all along, to create something capable of

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:31.970
destroying this universe.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:36.069
It turned out, the alternate universe he had
brought Tesla to was not the traveler’s

00:11:36.069 --> 00:11:42.680
home, rather a different place he wished to
destroy with the singularity that SCP-2700-Omega

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.790
would cause.

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:50.040
The traveler vanished to his true home, leaving
Nikola Tesla alone with SCP-2700.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:54.820
Saddened to think his invention would destroy
this new universe, which he found to be profoundly

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:58.629
beautiful, he made a truly unexpected decision.

00:11:58.629 --> 00:12:03.220
He returned home, and in his sadness, thought
it would be better if the device he’d helped

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:06.600
create brought about the end of our universe.

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:12.709
SCP-2700 is now a ticking time bomb, destined
to wipe out our entire reality unless the

00:12:12.709 --> 00:12:16.100
device can be disarmed or otherwise neutralized.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:21.660
All this, set in motion by a scientist long
dead, who submitted all of us as an unwilling

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:25.140
sacrifice for a universe we’d never know.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:29.839
Or perhaps this was done as an act of revenge
for his own lack of success and appreciation

00:12:29.839 --> 00:12:34.870
in life, one final act to make sure that if
he wasn’t remembered, no one else would

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:35.870
be either.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:40.410
Or maybe, just maybe, Tesla saw past the slights.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:45.560
Maybe he had so much faith in humanity that
he trusted we would one day be able to figure

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:51.709
out how to stop SCP-2700-Omega, and both universes
in the process.

00:12:51.709 --> 00:12:56.600
No matter his reasoning, all we can do now
is place our hope in the SCP Foundation’s

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:58.620
top minds to find a solution.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:01.449
But the clock is ticking.

00:13:01.449 --> 00:13:08.510
Now go check out “SCP-1461 - House of the
Worm” and “SCP-1765 - Sisters” for terrifying

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.920
tales of anomalous science gone wrong!

